main idea: 
solving the problem input a sorted array size n, 
and divide it into one or more subproblem.

implementation:

set q = middle of the array , if x = A[q], return q.

BinarySearch(A,p,r,x); #搵x

if p > r return; # if LHS>RHS return;
q = [(p+r)/2]   #頭尾相加/2 = middle
if A[q] = x return q #中就return pos
if x < A[q]
    BinarySearch(A,p,q-1,x);
else
    BinarySearch(A,右邊q+1,r,X);




